# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WHAT STAYS ON YOUR COMPUTER AND NEVER GOES TO GITHUB
#  ----------------------------------------------------------------
#  Listing a file here does NOT delete it. It stays in your folder
#  exactly as it is. It simply is not uploaded to the website.
#
#  THE IMPORTANT ONE: about-video.mp4 is 318 MB. GitHub refuses any
#  single file over 100 MB, and it refuses the WHOLE upload, not just
#  that file. Worse, once a big file has been committed even once it
#  stays buried in the history and has to be surgically removed. So it
#  has to be excluded before the very first upload, not after.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Old media the website no longer looks for ────────────────────
media/about-video.mp4
media/about-video cancelled.mp4
media/cancelled.mp4
media/final-video.mp4
media/about-poster.jpg
media/progress-02-01 cancelled.jpg
media/final-01.jpg
media/final-02.jpg
media/final-03.jpg
media/final-04.jpg
media/CaroleDanaf_2.jpg

# ── Your untouched original videos, kept as a safety net ────────
#  The compressed versions are what the website uses. These are the
#  full-size files they came from, in case you ever want them back.
media/_originals/
media/_compressed/

# ── Working files that mean nothing on a web server ──────────────
index-dark.html
EDIT MY WEBSITE TEXT.lnk
.claude/
__check*.html
__check*.js

# ── Windows / OneDrive clutter ───────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
~$*
